OL,5,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,6,     FThe Ulster Orchestra performs
OL,7,     Fmusic by Harty, Bruch, Grace
OL,8,     FWilliams and Arnold to mark its
OL,9,     F60th birthday.
OL,10,G2145 The Essay: Symphony of the Wild
OL,11,     FMusic is thought to be a
OL,12,     Fphenomenon unique to humans. But
OL,13,     Fdoes it echo deeper into the story
OL,14,     Fof life on earth? Ben Garrod
OL,15,     Fexplores expressions of music in
OL,16,     Four early ancestors.
OL,17,G2200 Late Junction
OL,18,     FIn the week of Bonfire Night,
OL,19,     FJennifer Lucy Allan picks sonic
OL,20,     Fbangers including tracks from
OL,21,     FPolar Praxis, Vanessa Rossetto,
OL,22,     Fand Archie Shepp.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
